"/us/en/about/news/2026/stryker-launches-t2-alpha-humerus-nailing-system": {"template":"news-detail","metadata":{"title":"Stryker launches T2 Alpha Humerus Nailing System, supporting surgical workflow and care for complex fractures","pageTitle":null,"description":"The system offers surgeons a streamlined approach to humeral fracture fixation while providing hospital teams with a unified platform that enables consistent, high-quality care.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/about/news/2026/stryker-launches-t2-alpha-humerus-nailing-system/t2-alpha-humerus-press-release-thumbnail.jpg","imageAlt":"t2-alpha-humerus-thumbnail","tags":["stryker:content-type/news","stryker:content-type/news/in-the-news","stryker:content-type/corporatenews"],"originallyPublished":"2026-02-11T14:07:00.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-02-11T14:07:00.000Z","contentID":"TR-T2AL-ARTI-2572930"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p><b>References</b></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Internal Report № D0000353370, Rev AA.</li>\r\n<li>Internal Report № D0000305724, Rev AA.</li>\r\n<li>Konda SR, Maseda M, et al. Observational prospective unblinded case-control study to evaluate the effect of the Gamma3® distal targeting system for long nails on radiation exposure and time for distal screw placement, Injury. 2023;54(2):677-682. doi:10.1016/j.injury.2022.11.046</li>\r\n<li>Naidu SH, Bixler B, Capo JT, Moulton MJ, Radin A. Percutaneous pinning of proximal humerus fractures: a biomechanical study. Orthopedics. 1997;20(11):1073–6.24.</li>\r\n<li>Horn J, Gueorguiev B, Brianza S, Steen H, Schwieger K. Biomechanical evaluation of two-part surgical neck fractures of the humerus fixed by anangular stable locked intramedullary nail. J Orthop Trauma. 2011;25(7):406–13.]</li>\r\n<li>T2 Alpha Humerus Nailing System Surgical Technique, TR-T2AL-SURGP-2363750, 09-2025&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
