"/us/en/about/news/features/committed-to-advancing-care-for-sarcoma": {"template":"news-detail","metadata":{"title":"Committed to advancing care for Sarcoma","pageTitle":null,"description":null,"image":"/content/dam/stryker/about/news/features/committed-to-advancing-care-for-sarcoma/sarcoma-thumbnail.png","imageAlt":null,"tags":["stryker:content-type/news"],"originallyPublished":null,"lastPublished":"2021-04-19T18:13:24.000Z","contentID":"GMRS-WC-3_25918 "},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p>A surgeon must always rely on his or her own professional clinical judgment when deciding whether to use a particular product when treating a particular patient. Stryker does not dispense medical advice and recommends that surgeons be trained in the use of any particular product before using it in surgery.</p>\r\n<p>The information presented is intended to demonstrate the breadth of Stryker's product offerings. A surgeon must always refer to the package insert, product label and/or instructions for use before using any of Stryker's products. Products may not be available in all markets because product availability is subject to the regulatory and/or medical practices in individual markets. Please contact your sales representative if you have questions about the availability of products in your area.</p>\r\n<p>Stryker Corporation or its divisions or other corporate affiliated entities own, use or have applied for the following trademarks or service marks: Stryker. All other trademarks are trademarks of their respective owners or holders.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1. Sarcoma Foundation of America. Sarcoma Awareness Month. Accessed 19 June 2020 <a href=\"https://www.curesarcoma.org/sarcoma-awareness-month/\" style=\"background-color: rgb(240,240,240);\">https://www.curesarcoma.org/sarcoma-awareness-month/</a><br>\r\n</p>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
