"/us/en/acute-care/news/the-importance-of-manufacturer-maintenance-plans-for-medical-equ": {"template":"news-detail","metadata":{"title":"The importance of manufacturer maintenance plans for medical equipment","pageTitle":null,"description":"In today's fast-paced medical environment, ensuring the reliability and performance of hospital equipment is paramount. One key decision facing many hospitals is choosing between original equipment manufacturer (OEM) and third-party Independent Service Organizations for their medical equipment maintenance needs. ","image":"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/Services/ProCare/Images/600x300_ProCare_main2.png","imageAlt":"Stryker ProCare medical device tech standing in a hospital hallway","tags":["stryker:content-type/news"],"originallyPublished":null,"lastPublished":"2024-02-06T18:34:06.000Z","contentID":"M0000017700 REV AA"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://www.nsmedicaldevices.com/analysis/tackling-counterfeit-medical-devices/https://www.nsmedicaldevices.com/analysis/tackling-counterfeit-medical-devices/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nsmedicaldevices.com/analysis/tackling-counterfeit-medical-devices/</a></p>\r\n<p>2. Li, J., Mao, Y., &amp; Zhang, J. (2022). Maintenance and Quality Control of Medical Equipment Based on Information Fusion Technology. <i>Computational intelligence and neuroscience</i>, <i>2022</i>, 9333328. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1155/2022/9333328https://doi.org/10.1155/2022/9333328\" target=\"_blank\">https://doi.org/10.1155/2022/9333328</a></p>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
