"/us/en/smart-care/news/building-a-connected-smart-hospital": {"template":"news-detail","metadata":{"title":"Beyond AI sensors: building a truly connected smart hospital","pageTitle":"Beyond AI sensors: building a truly connected smart hospital","description":"A connected smart hospital platform can reduce complexity, support clinician adoption and elevate the moments that matter most – for care teams and patients.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/smart-care/newsroom/why-smart-hospitals-need-more-than-ai-sensors/clinical-room-connected-care-monitoring-technology_1440x816.jpg","imageAlt":"Connected hospital room with patient in bed and digital monitoring system in use","tags":["stryker:content-type/news"],"originallyPublished":"2026-07-24T00:28:09.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-07-24T00:28:09.000Z","contentID":"SC-GSNPS-COMM-3341001"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p>1: Rajaei O, Khayami SR, and Rezaei MS. Smart hospital definition: Academic and industrial perspective. Int J Med Inform. 2024 Feb;182:105304. doi: 10.1016/j.ijmedinf.2023.105304. Epub 2023 Nov 28. PMID: 38065002.</p>\r\n<p>2: Huang, C., Wang, J., Wang S., et al. Internet of medical things: A systematic review. Elsevier. Neurocomputing Volume 557, 7 November 2023, 126719.</p>\r\n<p>3: RLDATIX | CHIME. Survey Brief. Modernizing Healthcare Operations: Insights from the CHIME Members Leadership Survey (CHIME 2026 Leadership Pulse Survey).</p>\r\n<p>4: Abernethy A, Asfar N, Anderson B, et al. National Academy of Medicine. Toward a National Health Digital and Data Architecture: Laying the Foundation for Digital Transformation. March 29, 2026.</p>\r\n<p>5: World Economic Forum. 4 ways data is improving healthcare. Dec 5, 2019. <a href=\"https://www.weforum.org/stories/2019/12/four-ways-data-is-improving-healthcare/\">4 ways data is improving healthcare | World Economic Forum</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6: Lehne M, Sass J, Shepers J, et al. NPJ Digital Medicine. Why digital medicine depends on interoperability. August 20, 2019.</p>\r\n<p>7: Almalki A, Alzahrani A, Sahluli F, et al. International Journal of Crisis and Risk Communication Research. Revolutionizing Healthcare: The Power of Health Information Systems: Medical records, health information. ISSN: 2576-0017 2024, VOL 7, NO S10.</p>\r\n<p>8: U.S. Food and Drug Administration. Study Data Technical Conformance Guide. 2025.</p>\r\n<p>9: Scientific Research in Hospital Solutions. Hospital Management. The Role of Interoperability in Hospital Information Systems. December 7, 2025. <a href=\"https://www.srhs.org/interoperability-in-hospital-information-systems\">https://www.srhs.org/interoperability-in-hospital-information-systems</a>.</p>\r\n<p>10: The Joint Commission. Sentinel Event Data 2024 Annual Review. 2025.</p>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[{"component":"customizable","title":"Related","items":[{"path":"/us/en/smart-care","resolved":true,"title":"Smart Care","description":"With care.ai, our SmartCare Platform offers a range of transformative services and capabilities in a single, integrated AI-enabled platform.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/smart-care/images/smart-care-bu_hero_1200x680.jpg","alt":"Nurse wearing Sync Badge looking back at patient in ProCuity bed"},{"path":"/us/en/smart-care/c/smart-hospitals-connecting-people-and-technology","resolved":true,"title":"Smart hospitals connecting people and technology","description":"The SmartHospital Platform reimagines care delivery and transforms facilities into a connected digital ecosystem. It brings together people, processes and technology to support real-time workflow adaptation.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/images/gold-adh-wave_1200x680.jpg","alt":"Abstract digital wave with dots and lines in a gold gradient"},{"path":"/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/smart-hospital","resolved":true,"title":"SmartHospital Platform","description":"The SmartHospital Platform reimagines care delivery and transforms facilities into a connected ecosystem. From patient rooms to operating suites, we enable seamless workflows that enhance outcomes and optimize resources.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/portfolios/medical-surgical/smarthospital-platform/Smart-Hospital-Platform_hero-thumbnail_1200x680.jpg","alt":"Vocera hands-free devices, ProCuity and Prime Series beds and care.ai Sensor"},{"path":"/us/en/smart-care/c/care-ai-human-centered-care","resolved":true,"title":"Empowering human-centered care","description":"As care tasks have become more complex, time consuming and fragmented the SmartCare Platform features a variety of AI-enabled workflows that can help deliver a responsive and personalized healthcare environment.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/products/care-ai/images/care-ai_patient-viewing-screen_1200x680.jpg","alt":"care.ai monitoring platform"}]}],"missingAlt":[]},
